---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
---
<!-- TODO: review before applying to AdSense. This policy covers baitaandessigns.com and its es., pt. and ar. subdomains. -->
<Layout title="Privacy policy | Baitaan Tools" description="How Baitaan Tools handles your data.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-stone-700">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This policy covers baitaandessigns.com and its subdomains es.baitaandessigns.com, pt.baitaandessigns.com and ar.baitaandessigns.com.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Data you enter</h2>
    <p>Our tools run in your browser. Numbers you type and files you choose are processed on your device and are not sent to our servers.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Analytics and advertising</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics to understand visits and Google AdSense to show ads. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. Visitors in the EU, UK and Switzerland are asked for consent first.</p>
    <p>You can opt out of personalised ads in <a class="text-teal-800 underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com">Google Ads Settings</a>. Learn more at <a class="text-teal-800 underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">policies.google.com</a>.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Contact</h2>
    <p>hello@baitaandessigns.com</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
